,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","file_format":"png","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","wrap_mode":"limited","pbr_channel":"color","fps":7,"frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"538d6902-12d4-5a10-813d-6697575e8b03","source":"data:image/png;base64,","relative_path":""}],"description":"# barracks\n\nBarracks: a long building, stone ground storey and timber upper storey, weapon racks outside and a practice yard with straw targets and a wooden practice post.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a compact hall of dark-stained timber on a cobble footing under a grey shingle roof, with a watch tower and bell at its left end and a stone chimney at its right. Its signature is the facade lined with round player-colour shields above lit shuttered windows; in front, a fenced sand training yard with straw dummies, archery butts, weapon racks and more shields on the fence.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a long hall of dark-stained timber on a cobble footing under a grey shingle roof, with a watch tower and bell at its left end and a stone chimney at its right. Its signature is the facade lined with round player-colour shields above lit shuttered windows; in front, a fenced sand training yard with straw dummies, archery butts, weapon racks and more shields on the fence.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 10 columns (224 x 160 units, 6.30 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -80..80, y 0..150, z -80..75 units.\n- Texture: 1024 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: finished 504, construction_0 68, construction_33 312, construction_66 448, ruined 321 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `barracks_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- barracks: 160 x 176 x 64 centred at x -16, z 40\n- practice yard: fence ring 204 x 16 x 60 at z -46 (walk-through)\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-2, 0, -6)\n- `fx_smoke` at (69, 142, 36)\n- `slot_rally` at (0, 0, -40)\n- `fx_window_4` at (-63, 69, 23.2)\n- `fx_window_5` at (-56, 69, 23.2)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-34, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_2` at (32, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_3` at (46, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_6` at (62.2, 49, 17)\n- `fx_window_7` at (62.2, 49, 55)\n- `fx_window_8` at (-27, 33, 68.8)\n- `fx_window_9` at (3, 33, 68.8)\n- `fx_window_10` at (33, 33, 68.8)"}